monster hunter rise was released back in  march of 2021 and with a score of nine  from us here at gamespot and a  metacritic of 88 i think it's safe to  say the game was a critical success and  now we're getting sun break the massive  new expansion to rise that features a  new setting new monsters and new ways to  take them down here's everything we know  so far about monster hunter rise sun  break  [Music]  monster hunter rise sunbury contains a  whole new story that picks up directly  from where the events of the main game  left off a sense of calm has finally  fallen over kimura village but  unfortunately it doesn't last long while  fighting off the cause of that  disturbance you encounter a knight of  the royal order named theorain together  with fiorine you sail off to elgato  outpost to investigate why monsters from  the kingdom are becoming more aggressive  and invading other areas this new  narrative will have you and fellow  hunters facing off against three  powerful new creatures known as the  three lords  elgato is a far off outpost that acts as  sun breaks new home base here hunters  will get to meet a whole new cast of  npcs who can assist in crafting and  sending you off on brand new quests some  of what you'll encounter within elgato  consist of the merchant shop where you  can craft health potions antidotes and  more from materials that you've gathered  however if you don't have time to pick  up resources on your adventures or  you're just a couple short the merchant  also has some in stock that you can buy  how convenient the blacksmith can help  you craft new gear from parts rewarded  upon quest completion this is also where  you can research new pieces upgrade your  weapons and outfit your buddies the  kimura tea shop is great for sitting  down for a meal and gaining bonuses  using the game's dango system this  system provides useful skills that are  different from the ones you get from  charms and armor the tea shop can also  be a great spot to craft items such as a  well done steak elgato outpost is also  where you can accept quests in the new  master rank difficulty which can be more  challenging than the base game seven  star hunts but when you're not busy  preparing you'll be out hunting in one  of sunbreak's new destinations each of  which offer new challenges to overcome  unique terrain to consider as well as  new materials and endemic life to  collect one of these locations is the  citadel area that features snowy peaks  lush forests and an abandoned fortress  right at the center  sunbreak will include different types of  monsters for the player to hunt this  includes aurora somnicanth which  releases a constant chilling mist that  threatens to freeze anything that gets  too close its abilities also allow it to  glide across icy terrain and exhale a  powerful ice breath attack magma  almadron is the opposite and instead  prefers the heat of the lava caverns and  augments its attacks with molten stone  to overwhelm the players meanwhile the  elder dragon malzino acts as the  commanding force behind the mysterious  swarm of parasitic entities that capture  and absorb the energy of their prey in  combat malzino's attacks are inspired by  the vampire using its blood blight  status to determine whose life force  will run out first if the hunter fails  malzino evolves into a stronger monster  in addition monster hunter rise will  also see the return of flying wyvern  seregios or the thousand edge dragon  which is best known for its high flying  maneuvers sharp blade scales coating its  body and a bleed status that can affect  players and if that wasn't enough  sunbreak also adds more powerful master  ranked versions of the monsters that  appeared in the base game monsters like  agnosome have a new backstep and  somersault attack while t-rex can combo  from a bite into a spin attack in order  to combat these new threats sunbreak  will introduce a new ability called  switch skill swap switch skill swap  enables hunters to assign switch skills  to two different loadouts which can be  changed on the fly during a hunt players  who find themselves under attack while  performing the ability can also perform  a swipe of aid in any direction to avoid  danger or simply to reposition for a  continued assault but be aware that  these evasive maneuvers cause stamina  when used switch skills are registered  to a red swap scroll and blue swap  scroll and can be alternated with  weapons drawn or put away monster hunter  rise sunbreak also introduces a new type  of quest called follower quests which  are single player only hunts that allow  you to accept and complete quests with  your favorite story characters to deepen  your bond with them capcom explained  that each follower has their own  specialization and can assist players in  battling by recovering their health  placing traps and riding monsters and  while the followers can be very helpful  in battle the quest does not depend on  their status so don't stress too much if  they fall in battle because it doesn't  count towards the failure condition of  that quest  similar to the base game monster hunter  rise sun break will include the ability  to play online or locally with up to  three of your friends once you're  connected with other players you can  embark on some quests together if  another player chooses a quest that you  haven't unlocked in your game yet you  will still be able to join them you'll  be able to keep rewards and materials  that you've earned but these quests  won't be marked as completed for you  [Music]  being an expansion to monster hunter  rise sunbreak will only be available on  the same platforms as the base game this  includes nintendo switch and pc via  steam capcom has said the game's update  will be around 13 gigabytes for all  players that want to access online  features but the studio didn't specify  if that number was for switch pc or both  monster hunter rise will be released on  june 30th 2022 and fans will have five  options for purchasing it the regular  digital edition costs 40 bucks while the  50 deluxe edition will include a handful  of bonus content such as new armor sets  gestures and hair stops for those who  are new to monster hunter you can take  advantage of the monster hunter rise  plus sun brake set that includes the  base game as well there will also be a  double deluxe version to the set as well  that includes bonus items for both the  base game and the expansion these two  versions aren't available for digital  pre-order but will be available for  purchase on release day in the physical  department there is a collector's  edition that offers the same digital  rewards as the deluxe edition as well as  some physical loot that includes a  sticker pack enamel pen steelbook case  and a malzino amiibo all players who  pre-order any version of the game will  get the loyal dog and striped cat armor  sets for their palamu and paliko  companions it will also be three  malzino-inspired amiibo for switch  players which will also unlock special  armor sets for palomut and paliko  companions and there you have it  everything we know so far about monster  hunter ryze sunbreak from the new  threats like elder dragon malzy notes to  the new features like switch skill swap  and follower quest you're gonna have a  ton of things to do when sun break  becomes available let us know what  you're doing to prepare for this  expansion in the comments below and make  sure you're subscribed to gamespot for  all the latest on monster hunter rise  [Music]  oh  [Music]  you
 

